<title>USA: Hershey Foods may tap corporate bond market.</title>
<headline>Hershey Foods may tap corporate bond market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hershey Foods Corp is rumored to be planning to tap the corporate bond primary market with a debt offering, syndicate sources said Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a 10-year maturity with price talk seen in the low 40 basis points area, they said.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to be underwritten by lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss 212-859-1675 ))</p>
</text>
